      "content": "Here's a draft of the performance review that addresses the concerns while being constructive and professional:\n\n\"Hi Jamie, \n\nI'd like to discuss a few areas of focus for improvement in your work as an engineer. Over the past three sprints, I've noticed that you've consistently missed deadlines on sprint tasks. We need to prioritize focusing on timely releases, and I'd appreciate it if we could revisit our project planning process to ensure we're setting realistic goals and timelines.\n\nAdditionally, I've reviewed the recent PRs and noticed a decline in code quality, with a higher incidence of basic syntax errors and logic bugs. I want to emphasize that I expect all engineers to adhere to our code standards, and I'm happy to provide additional guidance or support if needed.\n\nTo improve communication, I encourage you to reach out to the team when you're facing challenges or require feedback. Your silence during standups can prevent us from addressing potential issues sooner. Let's make sure to create an environment where everyone feels comfortable asking for help.\n\nLastly, I'd like to see a renewed focus on taking ownership of your modules and actively contributing to the team's shared knowledge. By doing so, we can foster a culture of collaboration and continuous improvement.\n\nLet's schedule a meeting",
